  "html": "<p>The Snow Forest is very similar to the Ice Cave. All the snow covered trees are great hiding places for mobs, and <a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Orok_Scout\" title=\"Ice Orok Scout\">Ice Orok Scouts</a> are particulary fond of using them for cover.\n</p>\n<table>\n<tr>\n<th>Snow Forest Layout Appearance\n</th><th>Snow Forest Layout Typical Map\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"thumb tnone\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:402px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Layout_Ice_Forest.jpg\" title=\"Layout Ice Forest.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"294\" src=\"/images/Layout_Ice_Forest.jpg\" width=\"400\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Layout_Ice_Forest.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div></div></div></div></div>\n</td><td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"thumb tnone\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:402px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Map_Ice_Forest.jpg\" title=\"Map Ice Forest.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"363\" src=\"/images/Map_Ice_Forest.jpg\" width=\"400\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Map_Ice_Forest.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div></div></div></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
